竹树阴中独自芳。\n已伴白莲羞远供，款陪黄菊荐陶觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"舞席歌筵自阔疏，曲生久送绝交书。\n平生嗜好消磨尽，留得枯棋了索居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"老去难堪痼疾缠，支离甘受众人怜。\n出门定被将迎困，紧闭风窗听雨眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袁本初二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"嬖孽朝兄主父囚，女戎衔猾史苏忧。\n便教官渡交绥去，二竖犹能乱冀州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"袁本初二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"入门偶藉移韩馥，健者何曾抗董公。\n须信阿瞒人物论，但言玄德是英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18821,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读晋史二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"只知成济犯乘舆，刘石凶威更有馀。\n狼顾魂灵应自反，尚将鬼责怖公闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18822,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读晋史二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"司马家儿转首亡，奸欺三叶是馀殃。\n区区牛氏何关汝，覆面犹须泪满床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18823,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"都下春日","author":"陈造","text":"烟林红翠已班班，雨后春工不暇悭。\n付与笙箫三万指，平分綵舫聒湖山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18824,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅水教次前韵","author":"陈造","text":"戈船干柂截江长，杀气氛昏日气黄。\n江畔诗翁泚椽笔，射蛟无复羡枞阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅史六首 其六","author":"陈造","text":"平时愤世谢王符，更肯佯狂踵接舆。\n须信有心端有累，与君乘木用舟虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅史六首 其五","author":"陈造","text":"徐稚申屠晚见机，当时张邴是先知。\n冥鸿久矣层霄上，置网弥山漫尔为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅史六首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"树威立敌祇商君，俯仰欺诬莽更文。\n何事君王自聪哲，三槐五鼎买崩分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅史六首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"公安枯竹本何知，摽表精忠解不私。\n应笑神奇甘臭腐，谗锋得意几馀时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阅史六首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"百战淮西仅奏功，澶渊欲战已平戎。\n三纡相绂犹公道，长为莱公羡晋公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高祖二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"坐馘关东扛鼎雄，指呼奴隶走王公。\n祇缘夺嫡中心慊，反畏商山鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高祖二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"未推壮邑赏平津，已采先知赦奉春。\n齐越淮南皆斧锧，狂胡遽指汉无人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"陈造","text":"雾红烟白忽横陈，雨后风光圣得新。\n说似游人须著便，阴寒已破一分春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄广教主僧二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"麦绾银丝稻荐珠，春窗曾是饭伊蒲。\n明朝再蜡登山屐，更肯开单共饱无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄广教主僧二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"回车半日赞公房，香积酥陀不一尝。\n可但山行休脚力，免教饥火燎枯肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea34