d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄张守仲思十首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"相从软语说睽离，起我清谭更好诗。\n别后忧虞今痛定，未须细诵悼亡辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄张守仲思十首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"一思交好一悲悽，楚峤吴山梦到迷。\n怕说万山天样远，房陵更在万山西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18843,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赵帅三首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"先生列馆似翘材，惯见琼筵为客开。\n夜夜元宵日寒食，一春尽可厕邹枚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18844,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赵帅三首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"银钩满纸堕荆扉，乐事如今与愿违。\n抚己可怜多病过，忆公深愧食言肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18845,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赵帅三首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"扬州灯火万家春，谁著诗翁寂寞滨。\n旧腊新年无好况，何须更问紫姑神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18846,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赵宰三首 其三","author":"陈造","text":"北山何意阻清游，似为江山挽得留。\n客未言归君好事，此盟端肯再寻不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18847,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄赵宰三首 其二","author":"陈造","tex